1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,190
[English subtitles are available.]

2
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:18,030
The Ranking of Kings [English subtitles are available.]

3
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:18,610
[English subtitles are available.]

4
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:21,230
depends on how many renowned knights does one have, [English subtitles are available.]

5
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,000
[English subtitles are available.]

6
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:25,460
the population of one's kingdom, the prosperity of its town

7
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:27,590
and more importantly,

8
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:30,280
is the king as mighty as the warrior?

9
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:34,780
Those are the conditions by which all the kings are ranked.

10
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,390
Prince.

11
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:44,540
Are you being bullied again?

12
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:47,850
It's okay.

13
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,850
You are strong.

14
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:53,680
You will overcome many obstacles

15
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:58,000
and become the world's best king.

16
00:00:58,790 --> 00:01:00,000
Promise me.

17
00:01:33,890 --> 00:01:38,820
[Ranking of Kings]

18
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:48,770
[Episode 1: The Naked Prince]

19
00:03:36,990 --> 00:03:38,640
What are you looking at?

20
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:41,900
Stand right there!

21
00:03:46,130 --> 00:03:47,810
I've never seen you before.

22
00:03:48,070 --> 00:03:50,490
You are even wearing a crown. Who are you?

23
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,480
I'm talking to you! How dare you ignore me?

24
00:03:55,570 --> 00:03:56,650
Whatever.

25
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,010
Listen.

26
00:03:58,380 --> 00:04:00,510
Give me your money if you want to live.

27
00:04:02,250 --> 00:04:03,930
Talk properly!

28
00:04:03,930 --> 00:04:05,520
I asked you to hand out your money!

29
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,700
What's wrong with you? You can't talk?

30
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:13,920
You can't even hear me?

31
00:04:16,130 --> 00:04:18,490
How am I supposed to talk to you then?

32
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,980
What?

33
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:23,870
"I have no money."

34
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:27,710
You can tell what I'm saying by reading my lips?

35
00:04:29,860 --> 00:04:32,660
"You can understand what I said."

36
00:04:32,990 --> 00:04:36,280
Yes, I have no idea how did I do that.

37
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:38,860
That doesn't matter!

38
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:41,720
If you have no money, take off your clothes and leave them here!

39
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:48,120
That's right. You are a good boy.

40
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:50,700
You're helping out a poor soul in destitution.

41
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:53,030
You're doing good work.

42
00:04:56,530 --> 00:04:58,870
You have a good future ahead of you.

43
00:04:59,570 --> 00:05:02,560
Very well. Wear something expensive again tomorrow.

44
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:05,500
All right? This stays between us.

45
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,290
Great. Now, run along.

46
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:12,490
What a stupid kid.

47
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:21,780
Who is that kid?

48
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:24,210
He's the eldest prince, Prince Bojji.

49
00:05:24,210 --> 00:05:26,100
He's the prince?

50
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:29,730
He was probably robbed.

51
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:32,280
But he's all smiles.

52
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:33,850
That's because he is a fool.

53
00:05:33,850 --> 00:05:36,790
He can't hear or speak.

54
00:05:36,810 --> 00:05:39,910
And he can't even swing a child's sword.

55
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,690
He's basically a useless prince.

56
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:46,920
He's not here yet.

57
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,620
Th... That brat...

58
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,860
Is he trying to set me up?

59
00:06:14,450 --> 00:06:16,290
Why are you so happy?

60
00:06:17,810 --> 00:06:20,260
"I'm glad that I get to talk to you."

61
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:23,090
What? You're happy because of something like this?

62
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:25,510
I see.

63
00:06:25,780 --> 00:06:28,150
You can't hear and you're stupid.

64
00:06:28,150 --> 00:06:30,150
That's why nobody wants to talk to you.

65
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:35,450
"That's right! You got it right!"

66
00:06:35,450 --> 00:06:36,660
You fool!

67
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:38,950
I'm making fun of you!

68
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:42,830
You're trickier than I thought.

69
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,450
What?

70
00:06:46,450 --> 00:06:50,130
"I will bring more clothes tomorrow. So wait for me here."

71
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:54,330
I don't take orders from anyone.

72
00:06:55,450 --> 00:06:56,740
What's your name?

73
00:06:58,230 --> 00:06:59,260
Bojji?

74
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,750
My name is Kage.

75
00:07:04,670 --> 00:07:05,900
It's fine.

76
00:07:06,150 --> 00:07:08,240
I'll see you tomorrow, Bojji.

77
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:14,440
I've never seen anyone like him.

78
00:07:15,370 --> 00:07:17,590
Whatever. His clothes are worth a lot.

79
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:19,210
I’ll wait for him.

80
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:46,690
What? You're the prince from that castle?

81
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:49,080
So you'll be the king?

82
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:54,900
"I want to be the world's greatest king."

83
00:07:57,290 --> 00:08:00,840
How are you supposed to be one?

84
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:03,570
You can't even hear or talk properly.

85
00:08:03,570 --> 00:08:05,930
You're really clueless.

86
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:13,310
Wh... What? "I still want to be the greatest king."

87
00:08:17,820 --> 00:08:19,080
All right.

88
00:08:19,290 --> 00:08:22,860
When you became a king, make this place where we don't have to work.

89
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:26,900
I will be waiting for that day to come.

90
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:40,690
He's being laughed at.

91
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:43,100
This is my fault.

92
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:46,150
He has been walking around naked lately.

93
00:08:46,150 --> 00:08:49,320
The fact that he might be the next king makes me worry.

94
00:08:50,650 --> 00:08:53,120
Why are you not wearing clothes?

95
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:53,820
She asked him!

96
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:54,880
Why?

97
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:55,700
He can't hear them anyway.

98
00:08:56,070 --> 00:08:56,930
All right, there.

99
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,700
The prince can't hear you.

100
00:08:59,700 --> 00:09:01,570
Why? Doesn't he have ears?

101
00:09:01,570 --> 00:09:04,240
Some people can't hear even though they have ears.

102
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:06,730
That means he won't know if we are trash talking?

103
00:09:06,830 --> 00:09:07,860
Dummy...

104
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:09,000
Enough.

105
00:09:11,410 --> 00:09:14,310
Say something.

106
00:09:17,930 --> 00:09:19,350
He's talking gibberish.

107
00:09:19,350 --> 00:09:20,580
Poor thing.

108
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:22,660
He's running away.

109
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:23,810
Wait.

110
00:09:24,150 --> 00:09:26,880
You should have told us if you can't talk!

111
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:28,690
What nonsense.

112
00:09:35,780 --> 00:09:37,020
This kid

113
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:39,980
has been living in such a place?

114
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:42,110
I feel pissed off all of a sudden.

115
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:44,420
He is naked again.

116
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,270
How embarrassing.

117
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:49,410
He probably doesn't know how stupid he is.

118
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:50,900
What a happy kid.

119
00:09:57,170 --> 00:09:59,800
He has really been walking around naked.

120
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:02,290
What's the meaning of this?

121
00:10:02,290 --> 00:10:02,310
Prince Bojji.

122
00:10:02,310 --> 00:10:03,390
[QUEEN HILING, PRINCE DAIDA'S BIRTHMOTHER] Prince Bojji.

123
00:10:03,390 --> 00:10:03,900
[QUEEN HILING, PRINCE DAIDA'S BIRTHMOTHER]

124
00:10:03,900 --> 00:10:05,290
He must have encountered a robber. [QUEEN HILING, PRINCE DAIDA'S BIRTHMOTHER]

125
00:10:05,290 --> 00:10:07,640
[LAW MINISTER, SANDEO] He must have encountered a robber.

126
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:08,230
[LAW MINISTER, SANDEO]
[THE BIG FOUR "SWORD MASTER" DOMAS]

127
00:10:09,010 --> 00:10:11,210
A prince has gotten robbed. This is embarrassing! [THE BIG FOUR "SWORD MASTER" DOMAS]

128
00:10:11,210 --> 00:10:13,050
[PRINCE BOJJI'S SWORDSMANSHIP INSTRUCTOR] A prince has gotten robbed. This is embarrassing!

129
00:10:13,050 --> 00:10:14,190
[PRINCE BOJJI'S SWORDSMANSHIP INSTRUCTOR]

130
00:10:14,190 --> 00:10:16,710
[THE BIG FOUR "SPEAR OF THE KING" APIS]

131
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,350
[THE BIG FOUR "SHIELD OF THE QUEEN" DRUSI] Domas.

132
00:10:19,350 --> 00:10:20,120
Yes. [THE BIG FOUR "SHIELD OF THE QUEEN" DRUSI] Domas.
[THE BIG FOUR "SHIELD OF THE QUEEN" DRUSI] Domas.

133
00:10:20,370 --> 00:10:22,450
Capture the robber.

134
00:10:22,450 --> 00:10:23,650
I'll sentence the man to death!

135
00:10:24,260 --> 00:10:25,160
Understood.

136
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,640
What? That's not it?

137
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:30,470
You were just playing for fun?

138
00:10:30,850 --> 00:10:32,840
There's no such game.

139
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:35,360
You are harming our royal family's dignity.

140
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:38,460
It could affect the stability of our kingdom.

141
00:10:38,780 --> 00:10:41,240
In that case, it is a crime worthy of death!

142
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:45,420
But now things are clear.

143
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:48,750
He has no right to be the king.

144
00:10:51,950 --> 00:10:53,310
You don't have to translate that!

145
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:57,600
Daida is a hundred times more befitting than him.

146
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:58,510
What?

147
00:10:58,930 --> 00:11:01,590
He seems to be in shock.

148
00:11:01,900 --> 00:11:03,390
I thought he can't hear.

149
00:11:03,790 --> 00:11:05,390
That's what I remember.

150
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:07,730
Let's go.

151
00:11:09,170 --> 00:11:12,840
Why does he have to be born first before Prince Daida?

152
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,940
I really hope it is based on meritocracy.

153
00:11:15,530 --> 00:11:18,070
Your attire is messy. I'll sentence you to death!

154
00:11:18,090 --> 00:11:19,880
I-I apologize!

155
00:11:20,770 --> 00:11:23,610
What's wrong with that histerical old woman?

156
00:11:23,870 --> 00:11:25,630
I can't believe she's the queen.

157
00:11:28,590 --> 00:11:29,640
Your Highness,

158
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:31,790
the king would like to see you.

159
00:11:32,610 --> 00:11:34,470
Please get changed and meet him.

160
00:12:08,570 --> 00:12:09,640
That kid…

161
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:12,740
He has been pretending to be fine

162
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:14,580
while bearing with everything.

163
00:12:16,990 --> 00:12:19,360
Where is he? Where did he go?

164
00:12:28,070 --> 00:12:29,680
You are one of the Shadow Clan, aren't you?

165
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:31,150
[THE BIG FOUR "THE SNAKE CHARMER" BEBIN] You are one of the Shadow Clan, aren't you?

166
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,160
[THE BIG FOUR "THE SNAKE CHARMER" BEBIN]

167
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:34,680
[PRINCE DAIDA'S SWORDSMANSHIP INSTRUCTOR] The cursed clan of assassins.

168
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:38,020
I thought you guys have been wiped out.

169
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:42,280
You're just a kid.

170
00:12:49,380 --> 00:12:50,220
Come in.

171
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:12,830
[7TH IN THE RANKING OF KINGS, KING BOSS]

172
00:13:12,830 --> 00:13:13,880
You are here. [7TH IN THE RANKING OF KINGS, KING BOSS]

173
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:14,400
[7TH IN THE RANKING OF KINGS, KING BOSS]

174
00:13:14,580 --> 00:13:15,580
Prince.

175
00:13:21,910 --> 00:13:24,270
Everything happened in an instant.

176
00:13:25,940 --> 00:13:30,380
Though the villagers fought hard, many people had been sacrificed.

177
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:32,880
What is that?

178
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:36,580
When they saw demons all over the mountain,

179
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:39,730
they couldn't help but question their fate.

180
00:13:44,590 --> 00:13:47,940
But that man appeared out of nowhere.

181
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:54,220
His fighting skills were overwhelming.

182
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:10,600
That was how the Boss Kingdom was founded.

183
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:13,690
Bojji.

184
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:17,870
I heard that you have been walking around naked.

185
00:14:18,410 --> 00:14:19,780
[PRIME MINISTER, SORI] What is going on?

186
00:14:19,780 --> 00:14:20,610
[PRIME MINISTER, SORI]
The people rely on us, the royalty. [PRIME MINISTER, SORI]

187
00:14:20,890 --> 00:14:24,670
The people rely on us, the royalty.

188
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,580
Were you robbed?

189
00:14:28,970 --> 00:14:30,840
Or were you bullied?

190
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,620
That doesn't matter.

191
00:14:34,150 --> 00:14:36,950
You're at fault for allowing it to happen...

192
00:14:38,770 --> 00:14:39,940
Your Majesty!

193
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:41,050
Fret not.

194
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:50,110
You're a memento of the last queen.

195
00:14:50,740 --> 00:14:52,680
You are adorable in my eyes.

196
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:54,170
But...

197
00:14:54,590 --> 00:14:59,260
it pains me to think about the fate of the kingdom after my death.

198
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:02,410
Your hands are too soft.

199
00:15:03,150 --> 00:15:06,190
Daida's hands have been toughened with hard work and training.

200
00:15:06,570 --> 00:15:12,070
I assigned the best sword master as your instructor.

201
00:15:12,490 --> 00:15:14,330
How can you not be strong?

202
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:16,010
Domas. Yes.

203
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:20,130
Train Prince Bojji even harder.

204
00:15:20,190 --> 00:15:21,030
Yes.

205
00:15:21,950 --> 00:15:24,670
My son, you have to train more.

206
00:15:26,140 --> 00:15:27,010
Now, go.

207
00:15:35,670 --> 00:15:37,320
Who assigned you?

208
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:39,210
And who are you planning to kill?

209
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:41,530
If you won't answer...

210
00:15:41,530 --> 00:15:43,080
Didn't I tell you already?

211
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:45,040
I won't kill...

212
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:47,950
That hurts...

213
00:15:47,950 --> 00:15:51,210
The Shadow Clan that assassinates for a living.

214
00:15:51,950 --> 00:15:55,590
You guys were the appointed assassin organization.

215
00:15:55,910 --> 00:15:58,820
You will never betray once you chose your master.

216
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:00,450
Shut it!

217
00:16:00,450 --> 00:16:04,410
But your clan tried to murder the king

218
00:16:04,410 --> 00:16:07,030
and they ended up being wiped out.

219
00:16:08,270 --> 00:16:09,900
Hey, just...

220
00:16:19,110 --> 00:16:20,630
He hid in the shadow?

221
00:16:22,990 --> 00:16:24,230
Be on the lookout.

222
00:16:25,020 --> 00:16:27,400
Though there's nothing he can do.

223
00:16:53,650 --> 00:16:54,940
How rough.

224
00:16:57,330 --> 00:16:58,950
Prince Daida.

225
00:16:59,260 --> 00:16:59,480
[SECOND PRINCE, DAIDA]

226
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,470
How is my brother's training? [SECOND PRINCE, DAIDA]

227
00:17:01,470 --> 00:17:02,030
[SECOND PRINCE, DAIDA]

228
00:17:02,030 --> 00:17:03,210
Has he gotten any stronger? [SECOND PRINCE, DAIDA]

229
00:17:03,210 --> 00:17:03,940
Has he gotten any stronger?

230
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:07,170
I would like to have a match with him.

231
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:11,270
That may be too early for him, though.

232
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:13,630
Why don't you be my opponent, then?

233
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:15,750
Me?

234
00:17:15,990 --> 00:17:17,060
That's right.

235
00:17:17,060 --> 00:17:18,900
It's fine if it's with you, right?

236
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:20,830
Well, but...

237
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:24,990
I heard he took down Bebin's first commanding officer of the chivalric order.

238
00:17:25,910 --> 00:17:27,670
He's too full of himself.

239
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:30,560
I'm not very keen. But I'll do as you say.

240
00:17:33,970 --> 00:17:36,960
I'll teach him a lesson.

241
00:17:44,450 --> 00:17:45,920
His aura

242
00:17:46,810 --> 00:17:48,540
is the same as King Boss.

243
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:01,210
Exceptional!

244
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:06,040
How about this?

245
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:06,970
Come on…

246
00:18:32,450 --> 00:18:34,210
Your swordsmanship is amazing.

247
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:44,450
You will definitely become stronger.

248
00:18:44,840 --> 00:18:46,470
This is the swordsmanship of a king.

249
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:49,390
I would love to teach him more.

250
00:18:56,050 --> 00:18:57,050
Prince Bojji.

251
00:18:58,940 --> 00:18:59,890
What?

252
00:19:00,430 --> 00:19:01,850
You would like to fight me?

253
00:19:06,970 --> 00:19:08,360
Darn it.

254
00:19:08,570 --> 00:19:11,540
Following that brat has landed me some trouble.

255
00:19:11,910 --> 00:19:13,700
I should leave this place as soon as possible...

256
00:19:13,700 --> 00:19:14,740
You know what?

257
00:19:15,110 --> 00:19:17,860
Prince Bojji and Prince Daida are going to have a match.

258
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:18,860
Let's check it out.

259
00:19:19,590 --> 00:19:21,110
A match?

260
00:19:24,090 --> 00:19:26,680
It's noisy out there. What's going on?

261
00:19:26,990 --> 00:19:29,510
It seems like Prince Daida and Prince Bojji are going to have a match.

262
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:33,330
A fight between brothers? That's foolish.

263
00:19:41,060 --> 00:19:43,530
Prince Bojji won't be able to win.

264
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,890
What exactly is he thinking?

265
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:48,020
Who do you think will win?

266
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:49,990
Do you even have to ask?

267
00:19:50,250 --> 00:19:53,640
Prince Daida defeated the first commanding officer, Bohen.

268
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:56,790
